      en: ["Total area of 269 square kilometers", "Oldest island in the archipelago geologically", "Designated a UNESCO Biosphere Reserve in 2020", "Contains the largest forest area in the country", "Highest peak is Monte Penoso at 436m", "Historically central to the Atlantic salt trade"],
