      en: ["Largest island in Cape Verde (991 km²)", "First island to be settled in 1460", "Home to the national capital, Praia", "Highest peak is Pico da Antónia at 1394m", "Site of UNESCO World Heritage Cidade Velha", "Most economically diverse island in the nation"],
